<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 5px 55px 0 55px;
        font-size: 15px;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      .main-title p {
        margin: 0px;
      }

      .main-title {
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 18px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #1b1818a9;
      }

      .main-title .child-2 {
        margin: 8px 0;
      }

      .main-title hr {
        border: 0;
        border-bottom: 2.5px solid black;
        margin-top: 5px;
      }

      .content-container {
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.7em;
      }

      .content-info {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
      }

      .content-value {
        max-width: 83%;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-left: 5px;
      }

      .owner-info-container {
        margin-left: 25px;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .owner-info-container .content-label {
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .owner-info-container .content-value {
        max-width: 45%;
        margin-left: 5px;
      }

      .beneficiary-info-container,
      .repatriation-info-container {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
        text-align: left;
        width: 100%;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .beneficiary-info-container .left {
        width: 49%;
      }

      .beneficiary-info-container .left .content-value,
      .beneficiary-info-container .right .content-value {
        max-width: 50%;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .beneficiary-info-container .right {
        width: 49%;
      }

      .repatriation-info-container .left {
        width: 45%;
      }

      .repatriation-info-container .right {
        width: 53%;
      }

      .repatriation-info-container .left .content-value,
      .repatriation-info-container .right .content-value {
        max-width: 50%;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .repatriation-info-container .right .content-value {
        max-width: 45%;
      }

      .terms-conditions-container {
        font-weight: 400;
        font-family: "DejaVuSansCondensed-Bold", serif;
      }

      .terms-conditions-container ol {
        margin-left: 15px;
      }

      .terms-conditions-container li {
        line-height: 1.7em;
      }

      .footer-content {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
        text-align: left;
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 15px;
      }
      .footer-content .copy-container {
        width: 50%;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .footer-content .copy-container ol {
        margin-left: 15px;
        line-height: 2em;
      }

      .signature-container {
        text-align: center;
        width: 48%;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        -ms-word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-all;
        word-break: break-word;
        line-height: 2em;
      }

      .annula-text {
        line-height: 0em;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="main-title">
        <p>Letter of Approval</p>
        <p class="child-2">
          For Repatriation of Technical Know-how /Assistance Fee
        </p>
        <p>
          (in case of the amount exceeding 6% of the cost of imported machinery)
        </p>
        <hr />
      </div>

      <div class="content-container">
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Ref. no:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.trackingId) %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Issue Date:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.certificateGenerateDate) %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.lastAmendmentDate) %>
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Name of Company:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName)
            %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Name of the Economic Zone:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.hiddenEconomicAddress)
            %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p>Owner/Managing Director/Chairman's Information</p>
        <div class="owner-info-container">
          <div class="content-info">
            <p class="content-label">
              Name of the Owner/Managing Director/Chairman:
            </p>
            <p class="content-value">
              <%=
              formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nameoftheOwnerInformation)
              %>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="content-info">
            <p class="content-label">
              National Identity Card No./Passport Number:
            </p>
            <p class="content-value">
              <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nidNo) %>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="content-info">
            <p class="content-label">Nationality:</p>
            <p class="content-value">
              <%=
              formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.authorizedNationality) %>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Office Address:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.officeAddress) %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="content-info">
          <p class="content-label">Nature of Business:</p>
          <p class="content-value">
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.natureOfBusiness) %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p>Information of Beneficiary:</p>
        <div class="beneficiary-info-container">
          <div class="left">
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                Name of the Beneficiary:
              </p>
              <p class="content-value" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.beneficiaryName) %>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label">Invoice no:</p>
              <p class="content-value">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.invoiceNo) %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="right">
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                Name of the Country:
              </p>
              <p class="content-value" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.conutryName) %>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label">Date:</p>
              <p class="content-value">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.date) %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Repatriation of Technical Know-how /Assistance Fee:</p>
        <div class="repatriation-info-container">
          <div class="left">
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label">Amount to be remitted:</p>
              <p class="content-value">
                <span
                  ><%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currency) %> </span
                ><span
                  ><%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyValue)
                  %></span
                >
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                Name of the AD Bank:
              </p>
              <p class="content-value" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nameOfTheADBank) %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="right">
            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label">Cost of imported machinery :</p>
              <p class="content-value">
                <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.importCostOfMachineryOfTheLastYear)
                %>
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-info">
              <p class="content-label" style="line-height: 1.5em">FCA No:</p>
              <p class="content-value" style="line-height: 1.5em">
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.fcaNo) %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Terms and Conditions:</p>
        <div class="terms-conditions-container">
          <ol>
            <li>
              The stated amount of Technical Know-how Fee shall be remitted only
              after being confirmed of all liabilities which are to be paid
              locally such as Tax, VAT, Tax deducted at source etc. (if
              applicable);
            </li>
            <li>
              The necessary documents and the Certificate of receiving Services
              shall be submitted to the bank (Authorized Dealer);
            </li>
            <li>
              The stated approval shall remain effective 45 (forty-five) days
              from the date of issuance
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="copy-container">
          <p>Copy for Information to:</p>
          <ol type="a">
            <li>
              Managing Director, <%=
              formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.hiddenEconomicZoneName)
              %>
            </li>
            <li>........................................</li>
            <li>........................................</li>
            <li>........................................</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <!-- <div class="signature-container">
          <p>Yours faithfully</p>
          <div class="signature-img"><%-formValue.deskUserSignature %></div>
          <p>
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserFullName) %>
          </p>
          <p>
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserDesignation) %>
          </p>
          <p>Bangladesh Economic Zones Authority (BEZA)</p>
        </div> -->
      </div>
      <div
        style="
          text-align: center;
          background: #dfbdcd;
          padding: 24px 0 24px 0;
          font-weight: 600;
          color: rgb(171, 34, 34);
          margin-top: 12px;
          opacity: 0.8;
        "
      >
        <p>
          THIS IS A COMPUTER GENERATED PERMIT. SO SIGNATURE IS NOT REQUIRED.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
